  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Thinly slice capsicum. Thinly slice zucchini into half-moons. Slice red onion (see ingredients) into thick wedges.\n• Place the prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 18-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8e1676038927854113bd-f47cee6c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the veggies are roasting, cook penne in the boiling water, stirring occasionally, until 'al dente', 10 minutes. Reserve some pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people / 2/3 cup for 4 people), then drain the pasta and return it to the pan. TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8e1676038927854113bd-608269ff.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the pasta is cooking, finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8e1676038927854113bd-03d14651.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add diced tomatoes with garlic & olive oil, the butter and some pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people / 2/3 cup for 4 people), stirring to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8e1676038927854113bd-3dd35b22.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add vegetable stock pot to the sauce and stir to combine. Reduce heat to medium and simmer until thickened, 2-4 minutes.\n• Remove from the heat and stir in the roasted veggies, red pesto, baby spinach, Cheddar cheese and cooked penne. Season to taste. TIP: Add another splash of pasta water if the sauce is too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8e1676038927854113bd-70b01854.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the roasted veggie and red pesto penne between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese and flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8e1676038927854113bd-0762ac09.jpeg"
    }
  ]
